      "conditionalPreludes":[{"flag":"ch2EventMapKnown","equals":true,"lines":[{"speakerId":"kai","expression":"thinking","text":"我看到你們標的集合地點了，我往那邊走。"}]},{"flag":"ch2EventMapKnown","equals":false,"lines":[{"speakerId":"mio","expression":"thinking","text":"入口那邊好像有活動地圖，也許能用它說明集合地點。"}]}],
      "lines":[{"speakerId":"mio","expression":"surprised","text":"已經有人問我是不是就在拍照區旁邊了。反應也太快了吧。"},{"speakerId":"kai","expression":"nervous","text":"你們到底在哪？"},{"speakerId":"kai","expression":"thinking","text":"我進來了，但這裡比我想像中大。"}],"choices":[],"endText":"KAI 正在會場裡尋找你們。"
    },
    {
      "id":"ch2_act1_consequence_general_now","label":"ECHO · 即時反應","sceneId":"ch2_community_event",
