      "lines":[{"speakerId":"mio","expression":"thinking","text":"大家知道我在活動會場，但還不知道我們在會場的哪一區。"},{"speakerId":"kai","expression":"nervous","text":"你們到底在哪？"},{"speakerId":"kai","expression":"thinking","text":"我進來了，但這裡比我想像中大。"}],"choices":[],"endText":"KAI 正在會場裡尋找你們。"
    },
    {
      "id":"ch2_act1_consequence_none_now","label":"ECHO · 即時反應","sceneId":"ch2_community_event",
      "participants":[{"characterId":"mio","position":"left","expression":"surprised"},{"characterId":"kai","position":"right","expression":"nervous"}],
      "conditionalPreludes":[{"flag":"ch2EventMapKnown","equals":true,"lines":[{"speakerId":"kai","expression":"thinking","text":"我看到你們標的集合地點了，我往那邊走。"}]},{"flag":"ch2EventMapKnown","equals":false,"lines":[{"speakerId":"mio","expression":"thinking","text":"入口那邊好像有活動地圖，也許能用它說明集合地點。"}]}],
      "lines":[{"speakerId":"mio","expression":"surprised","text":"我沒有標位置，還是有人從帳棚和活動旗幟猜到我在會場。"},{"speakerId":"kai","expression":"nervous","text":"你們到底在哪？"},{"speakerId":"kai","expression":"thinking","text":"我進來了，但這裡比我想像中大。"}],"choices":[],"endText":"KAI 正在會場裡尋找你們。"
    },
    {
