      "conditionalPreludes":[{"flag":"ch2EventMapKnown","equals":true,"lines":[{"speakerId":"kai","expression":"thinking","text":"我看到你們標的集合地點了，我往那邊走。"}]},{"flag":"ch2EventMapKnown","equals":false,"lines":[{"speakerId":"mio","expression":"thinking","text":"入口那邊好像有活動地圖，也許能用它說明集合地點。"}]}],
      "lines":[{"speakerId":"mio","expression":"happy","text":"先存起來也好。等離開拍照區後再發布，照片就不會立刻說出我們的位置。"},{"speakerId":"kai","expression":"nervous","text":"你們到底在哪？"},{"speakerId":"kai","expression":"thinking","text":"我進來了，但這裡比我想像中大。"}],"choices":[],"endText":"KAI 正在會場裡尋找你們。"
