      "lines":[{"speakerId":"kai","expression":"happy","text":"找到你們了。這張地圖和集合地點還真的有用。"},{"speakerId":"kai","expression":"thinking","text":"所以你們剛剛發給誰看？"},{"speakerId":"mio","expression":"neutral","text":"朋友啊。"},{"speakerId":"kai","expression":"thinking","text":"哪些朋友？"}],
